---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Referencias bibliográficas" active="/referencias">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="tag">Página de Referencias Bibliográficas</span>
      <h1>Fuentes consultadas</h1>
      <p>Todas las fuentes utilizadas en la elaboración de este blog.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <section>
      <h2>Libros y textos</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>Stallings, W. (2019). <em>Computer organization and architecture: Designing for performance</em> (11th ed.). Pearson.</li>
        <li>Tanenbaum, A. S., & Austin, T. (2013). <em>Structured computer organization</em> (6th ed.). Pearson.</li>
        <li>Patterson, D. A., & Hennessy, J. L. (2017). <em>Computer organization and design: The hardware/software interface</em> (5th ed.). Morgan Kaufmann.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Documentación técnica</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>National Instruments. (2023). <em>NI-DAQmx user manual</em>. https://www.ni.com/docs/en-US/bundle/ni-daqmx/page/usermanual.html</li>
        <li>National Instruments. (2023). <em>PCIe-6321 specifications</em>. https://www.ni.com/docs/en-US/bundle/pcie-6321-specs/page/specs.html</li>
        <li>PCI-SIG. (2022). <em>PCI Express base specification, revision 5.0</em>. https://pcisig.com/specifications</li>
        <li>Blackmagic Design. (2024). <em>DeckLink SDK manual</em>. https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/developer</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Recursos web</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>Magewell. (2023). <em>MWCapture SDK documentation</em>. https://www.magewell.com/capture/pro-capture</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Imágenes utilizadas</h2>
      <ul class="brutal">
        <li>National Instruments. (2024). <em>NI PCIe-6321</em> [Imagen]. https://ni.scene7.com/is/image/ni/06160930</li>
        <li>National Instruments. (2024). <em>NI SCB-68A</em> [Imagen]. https://ni.scene7.com/is/image/ni/05101218-1</li>
        <li>ASUS. (2024). <em>PRIME B760M-A D4</em> [Imagen]. https://www.asus.com/motherboards-components/motherboards/prime/prime-b760m-a-d4/</li>
