        <li>Walmart. (2024). <em>Kingston FURY Beast 16GB DDR4</em> [Imagen]. https://www.walmart.com/ip/Kingston-FURY-Beast-16GB-2x8GB-3200MHz-DDR4-CL16-Desktop-Memory-Kit-of-2-KF432C16BBK2-16/316372856</li>
        <li>Walmart. (2024). <em>WD Blue SN580 1TB NVMe</em> [Imagen]. https://www.walmart.com/ip/WD-Blue-1TB-SN580-NVMe-Internal-SSD-WDBWMY0010BBL-WRWM/5080177169</li>
        <li>Corsair. (2024). <em>CX Series CX550</em> [Imagen]. https://www.corsair.com/us/en/p/psu/cp-9020277-na/cx-series-cx550-550-watt-80-plus-bronze-atx-power-supply-cp-9020277-na</li>
